Sat Nov 14 17:50:42 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Upgrade to upstream version 1.4.0
  * New features and improvements
    + Make BuildContext.getValue generic
  * Bug Fixes
    + Give DefaultProgress a single scope annotation
  * Maintenance
    + Declare the Maven artifacts the code uses
    + Keep SLF4J on 1.7.x in Dependabot
  * Build
    + Run unit tests and cover the components
    + Allow running the release drafter by hand
    + Draft the version the labels imply, not always a patch
  * Dependency updates
    + Bump org.eclipse.sisu:org.eclipse.sisu.plexus from 1.1.0 to
      1.1.2
    + Bump org.apache.maven:maven-core from 3.9.16 to 3.10.0
    + Bump release-drafter/release-drafter from 7.7.0 to 7.10.0
- Changes of version 1.3.0
  * New features and improvements
    + Delegate getValue/setValue in DefaultBuildContext to legacy
      build API
    + Create dedicated Messages API
    + Remove obsolete TODO comments from BuildContext interface
    + Add a Progress API
    + Fix Artifact id returned instead of project version
    + Add support for sending mojo execution events
    + Use EventSpy to handle execution of events
    + Add a connect API for inter-process-communication between
      maven and IDE
    + Establish an automatic module name
  * Documentation updates
    + Describe the artifact in the POM
  * Build
    + Update parent to plexus 27
  * Dependency updates
    + Bump plexus-utils to 4.1.0
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus from 13 to 26
    + Bump release-drafter/release-drafter from 5 to 7.7.0
    + Bump org.eclipse.sisu:org.eclipse.sisu.plexus from 0.9.0.M2 to
      1.1.0
    + Bump org.apache.maven:maven-core from 3.9.9 to 3.9.16
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-utils from 4.0.0 to 4.0.3
    + Bump maven-surefire-plugin from 3.1.0 to 3.1.2

